BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 792.00 Td (12. known limitations) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 780.00 Td (13. troubleshooting) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 768.00 Td (14. design philosophy) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 756.00 Td (15. license and credits) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 732.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 720.00 Td (1. WHAT IS TXT2PDF?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 708.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 684.00 Td (txt2pdf is a zero-dependency command-line utility that converts plain text) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 672.00 Td (files into structured PDF 1.4 documents.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 648.00 Td (Unlike Pandoc, wkhtmltopdf, or Python-based converters that require hundreds) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 636.00 Td (of megabytes of runtime dependencies, txt2pdf is a small static binary.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 612.00 Td (It parses text, calculates page breaks, generates PDF objects, and writes) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 600.00 Td (the final binary stream directly to disk using only the C standard library.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 576.00 Td (It is designed for environments where installing dependencies is impossible,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 564.00 Td (unwanted, or where the network is down.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 540.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 528.00 Td (2. WHAT IS NEW IN V1.7.2?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 516.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 492.00 Td (Version 1.7.2 adds optional Unicode font support for Japanese, Chinese,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 480.00 Td (Korean and other scripts covered by the selected TrueType font.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 456.00 Td (Main changes:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 432.00 Td (- Added --font FILE.ttf mode.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 420.00 Td (- Added embedded TrueType font support.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 408.00 Td (- Added Unicode CJK output using PDF Type0 / CIDFontType2.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 396.00 Td (- Added /Identity-H encoding.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 384.00 Td (- Added /ToUnicode maps for copy, paste and search.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 372.00 Td (- Added real glyph metrics from the TTF for line wrapping.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 360.00 Td (- Added UTF-16BE bookmark titles for CJK outlines.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 348.00 Td (- Added automatic TrueType subsetting.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 336.00 Td (- Kept the classic Base14 mode unchanged when --font is not used.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 312.00 Td (Example size impact:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 288.00 Td (- Full Noto Sans JP embedded: ~5 MB PDF) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 276.00 Td (- Same document with v1.7.2 subsetting: ~75 KB PDF) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 252.00 Td (The default behavior remains unchanged:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 228.00 Td (- Courier is still the default font.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 216.00 Td (- Existing v1.7.1 documents convert exactly as before.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 204.00 Td (- CJK mode and subsetting are opt-in features.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 180.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 168.00 Td (3. FONTS AND TYPOGRAPHY) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 156.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 132.00 Td (txt2pdf v1.7.2 supports two font pipelines.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 108.00 Td (A. Base14 fonts \(classic mode\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 84.00 Td (    --mono     Courier \(default, classic txt2pdf layout\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 72.00 Td (    --sans     Helvetica \(clean, modern, proportional\)) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
