BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 792.00 Td (    --serif    Times-Roman \(classic documentation look\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 768.00 Td (    Examples:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 744.00 Td (        ./txt2pdf --mono input.txt output.pdf) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 732.00 Td (        ./txt2pdf --sans input.txt output.pdf) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 720.00 Td (        ./txt2pdf --serif input.txt output.pdf) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 696.00 Td (    Important notes:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 672.00 Td (    - Base14 fonts are not embedded into the PDF.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 660.00 Td (    - PDF viewers normally provide built-in substitutes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 648.00 Td (    - Courier layout remains fixed-width and highly predictable.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 636.00 Td (    - Helvetica and Times-Roman use built-in ASCII metrics for wrapping.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 624.00 Td (    - Accents and non-ASCII characters remain limited to WinAnsiEncoding.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 600.00 Td (B. Embedded TrueType font \(CJK mode\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 576.00 Td (    --font FILE.ttf) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 552.00 Td (    Examples:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 528.00 Td (        ./txt2pdf --font NotoSansJP-Regular.ttf roadmap.txt roadmap.pdf) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 516.00 Td (        ./txt2pdf --font NotoSansSC-Regular.ttf input.txt output.pdf) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 504.00 Td (        ./txt2pdf --font NotoSansKR-Regular.ttf input.txt output.pdf) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 480.00 Td (    Important notes:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 456.00 Td (    - The font must be an individual TrueType .ttf file.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 444.00 Td (    - OpenType/CFF .otf files are not supported yet.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 432.00 Td (    - TrueType collections .ttc are not supported yet.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 420.00 Td (    - When --font is used, it overrides --sans, --serif and --mono.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 408.00 Td (    - The selected font is used for ALL text \(ASCII, Latin, CJK\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 396.00 Td (    - Only the glyphs actually used in the document are embedded.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 372.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 360.00 Td (4. IMAGE SUPPORT) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 348.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 324.00 Td (txt2pdf v1.7 supports standalone block images.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 300.00 Td (Supported image tags:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 276.00 Td (    [IMG]photo.jpg[/IMG]) Tj ET
