BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 252.00 Td (    [IMG]chart.png[/IMG]) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 228.00 Td (The image line must be the only content on that line.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 204.00 Td (Good image line:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 180.00 Td (    [IMG]chart.png[/IMG]) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 156.00 Td (Bad image line:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 132.00 Td (    See this chart: [IMG]chart.png[/IMG]) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 108.00 Td (Supported formats:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 84.00 Td (- JPEG: Embedded using PDF native DCTDecode passthrough.) Tj ET
