BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 624.00 Td (Image layout behavior:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 600.00 Td (- Images are treated as standalone content blocks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 588.00 Td (- Aspect ratio is preserved.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 576.00 Td (- Images wider than the text area are scaled down.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 564.00 Td (- Images taller than the page are scaled down to fit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 552.00 Td (- An image may force a page break if it does not fit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 540.00 Td (- Image paths are relative to the current working directory.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 528.00 Td (- The PDF stores the original compressed image data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 516.00 Td (- Reducing source image size reduces final PDF size.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 492.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 480.00 Td (5. PARSER RULES) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 468.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 444.00 Td (The parser creates PDF bookmarks only for lines that are real section) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 432.00 Td (headers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 408.00 Td (A line is considered a section header only if all of these conditions are) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 396.00 Td (true:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 372.00 Td (- It starts with a digit, optionally followed by letters, then a dot.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 360.00 Td (- The title text after the dot contains only uppercase letters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 348.00 Td (- The line is surrounded by separator lines made mostly of '=' characters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 336.00 Td (- The line is not inside a contents block.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 312.00 Td (Valid section shape:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 288.00 Td (- separator line) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 276.00 Td (- uppercase numbered title) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 264.00 Td (- separator line) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 240.00 Td (Rejected lines:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 216.00 Td (- numbered titles containing lowercase letters) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 204.00 Td (- numbered titles used as examples inside normal paragraphs) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 192.00 Td (- numbered titles not surrounded by separator lines) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 180.00 Td (- numbered titles inside the contents block) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 156.00 Td (This makes the parser much safer for manuals that contain examples.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 132.00 Td (The parser supports hierarchical IDs such as:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 108.00 Td (- 1) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 96.00 Td (- 2.3) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 84.00 Td (- 2.3.1) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 72.00 Td (- 11.14) Tj ET
endstream
