BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 744.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 732.00 Td (6. TABLE OF CONTENTS RULES) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 720.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 696.00 Td (Internal links are created only from contents blocks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 672.00 Td (A contents block is detected when:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 648.00 Td (- a line contains the token "[TOC]") Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 636.00 Td (- the next non-blank line is a separator line) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 624.00 Td (- the block ends at the next separator line) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 600.00 Td (Rules for entries:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 576.00 Td (- entries must be numbered lines) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 564.00 Td (- lowercase entries are recommended) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 552.00 Td (- entries are not converted into bookmarks) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 540.00 Td (- entries are linked to the matching section by number or title) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 528.00 Td (- uppercase entries inside the contents block are also ignored as bookmarks) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 504.00 Td (This means the old duplicate-bookmark problem is largely eliminated by the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 492.00 Td (parser itself.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 468.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 456.00 Td (7. USAGE AND DEBUG MODE) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 444.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 420.00 Td (Basic usage:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 396.00 Td (    ./txt2pdf input.txt output.pdf) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 372.00 Td (Font selection:) Tj ET
