BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 564.00 Td (14. DESIGN PHILOSOPHY) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 552.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 528.00 Td (Modern software development has forgotten how to build small tools.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 504.00 Td (We wrap simple text transformations in Electron apps, Node.js runtimes,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 492.00 Td (and Docker containers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 468.00 Td (txt2pdf is a rejection of that bloat.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 444.00 Td (It proves that a fully functional, structured document generator can fit) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 432.00 Td (in a tiny static binary, written in pure C11, with zero external) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 420.00 Td (dependencies.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 396.00 Td (When the cloud goes down, and the package managers fail to resolve,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 384.00 Td (the Spartan tool remains.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 360.00 Td ("Code is neither created nor destroyed; it is distilled.") Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 336.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 324.00 Td (15. LICENSE AND CREDITS) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 312.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 288.00 Td (Source code : GPLv3) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 276.00 Td (Manual: GFDL v1.3) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 252.00 Td (txt2pdf was written as a demonstration of minimalist software design.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 228.00 Td (Inspired by the Unix philosophy: do one thing well.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 204.00 Td (Built with minimalism, on a potato, for potatoes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 180.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 168.00 Td (END OF DOCUMENTATION) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 156.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
